    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d6">

                <pb facs="0096" n="6" xml:id="pg6"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/8038</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Russia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Francis</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Petrograd</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1917-12-08T21:00:00+03:31"><hi rendition="#italic">December 8,
                                1917, 9 p.m.</hi></date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received December 11, 12.18
                        a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2073. Afternoon papers state thousand Japanese militia landed Vladivostok from
                    transport convoyed by cruiser <hi rendition="#italic">Okuma</hi>. Called
                    Japanese Ambassador, read statement to him. He says had no advices and believed
                    report untrue.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Francis</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
